<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <title>Noah Humbert</title>
        {% include 'partials/_head.html.twig' %}
    </head>

    <body>
        <!-- Top Navitation Bar-->
        {% include 'partials/_navbar.html.twig' %}

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="container mt-2 mb-2 text-center">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <p class="fs-1 my-0">Mentorship Program</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Top Screen Schedule button -->
        <div class="row mt-1 justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-2 col-6 d-grid gap-2">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://calendar.app.google/nyvMuGC8DBSDuFK3A">Book a Free Call</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- About Me Portion -->
        <div class="container my-5">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
                <div class="col-11">
                    <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <img src=" {{ asset('images/noah.png') }} " class="card-img-top" alt="Noah">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4">Why Listen to me?</h5>
                                    <p class="fs-6 mb-1">At 18, I was a 4.2 GPA student at the top of my class when I made the decision to build my own path instead of following the traditional college route.</p>
                                    <br>
                                    <p class="fs-6 my-1">I started working full-time in IT, gaining real-world experience and learning how businesses operate from the inside. Over the last year, I've helped implement and improve hundreds of business-critical processes while continuing to build my skills.</p>
                                    <br>
                                    <p class="fs-6 my-1">At 19, I purchased my first home.</p>
                                    <br>
                                    <p class="fs-6 my-1">To me, that wasn't just buying a house — it was proof that intentional decisions, discipline, and long-term thinking can create opportunities at any age.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Who? -->
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
                <div class="col-11">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-6">
                            <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                                <div class="row g-0">
                                    <div class="col-12">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4 text-center">Who It's For?</h5>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-1">A lot of young adults leave high school with no clear direction. <p>
                                            <br>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-0">They know they want more, but they don't know:</p>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-0">- What career path to pursue</p>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-0">- How to build valuable skills</p>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-0">- How to manage money</p>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-0">- How to create discipline and consistency</p>
                                            <br>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-1">I created this mentorship to provide the guidance I wish I had when I was starting out</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-6">
                            <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                                <div class="row g-0">
                                    <div class="col-12">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4 text-center">Why do you need me?</h5>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-1">You don't have any direction and the Youtube Gurus are lying to you for quick cash.<p>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-1">My guide will work long-term for the rest of your life by fixing the route cause of your issues.<p>
                                            <p class="fs-6 my-1">Gain access to a network of likeminded individuals dedicated to making their lives better.<p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
                <div class="col-11">
                    <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p class="fs-1 my-0">Schedule a free 1-on-1 call</p>
                                </div>
                                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://calendar.app.google/nyvMuGC8DBSDuFK3A">Book a Free Call</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
                                